## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design multi-tenant isolation, scalable serverless compute, and secure per-env deployments in Azure.

## Key Concepts

- Tenant isolation across Cosmos DB, Blob, and queues
- SAS-based blob access and tenant-scoped keys
- Ingress API with auth, compute orchestration, and durable state
- Per-env deployment pipelines (dev/stage/prod) with Key Vault and App Configuration

## Code Example

```csharp
// Azure Function: extract tenant and route to per-tenant resources
public static async Task<IActionResult> Run(HttpRequest req, ILogger log)
{
  string tenantId = req.Headers["X-Tenant-Id"].FirstOrDefault();
  if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(tenantId)) return new UnauthorizedResult();
  // Use tenantId for Cosmos/Blob operations
  return new OkResult();
}
```

